/// M02 CORE-023 "bundled generics: definitions/helper/main roots green,
/// silent run".
/// Source: tests/integration/generics_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledGenerics.
/// Related fixtures: compiler/testdata/current/generics/definitions.can,
/// helper.can, main.can (ground for every root pin below: identity 2, read
/// 2, make 1, main 1 = 6 roots).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with passed report and exactly
/// 6 roots grounded per function in definitions/helper/main.can, silent
/// production run (exit 0, empty stdout, empty stderr).
/// The wrong-type unreachable-branch build rejection lives in
/// core-023-wrong-type-rejection.can; the finite-transition,
/// finite-field-chain and spread-inferred source variants live in
/// core-023-source-variants.can.
/// Variants: definitions/helper/main fixture set.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and
/// C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23).
/// Case bundled/generics-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-set, identity-roots, read-roots, make-roots,
/// main-roots, run-silent.
/// Facet map (generics_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L76-79: exit 0, empty stderr); report-passed/root-count pin the report
/// leg (L80-83: passed true, 6 assertions); fixture-set grounds the 6 roots
/// in definitions.can+helper.can+main.can; identity-roots pins identity
/// (definitions.can L11-13: 3 => ok 3, "x" => ok "x"); read-roots pins read
/// (definitions.can L18-20: box(3, []) => ok 3, box("x", []) => ok "x");
/// make-roots pins make (helper.can L6-7: => ok box(7, [])); main-roots pins
/// main (main.can L8-9: [] => ok); run-silent pins the run leg (L84-87: exit
/// 0, empty stdout, empty stderr).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
